The slide seems to have come through the "one of the referents of" locution=
, which started when the noun involved was a proper name {me la Kraislr} as=
 "a thing called a Chrysler," more or less, which then got extended when no=
n-names were used: "a thing called a the three kings" doesn't make much sen=
se except as "a thing that is a referent of 'the three kings'" and hence to=
 member ship.=A0 Of course, if {me} is restricted to proper names it has ev=
en less use (but is till important when needed) and so the shift to jest is=
 probably wise.=A0 Pity, it made JCB so happy when he found it.




